                "description": "Made with a life of luxury in mind, the Georgetown Lever with Windsor Plate is stunningly designed. Its ornate style will add intricate detail to any door. This Georgetown Leverset with Windsor Plate is made out of solid forged brass. The Windsor Plate with Georgetown Lever will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
